  triage:title "D5 says compose resolves `repo` with `discover_main_repo_root(cwd)`" ;
  triage:description "D5 says compose resolves repo with discover_main_repo_root(cwd). The implementation starts from the explicit repo root when one is set, else the working directory, and a dry run skips git. This is a sound choice because it keeps --repo-root and the logged repo in agreement. The implementation note admits the plan names only the working directory." ;
